WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
FlexPart: Text-controlled 3D part segmentation.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
First, provide a 3D mesh and a control prompt.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
FlexPart assigns part identities directly to the mesh.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Mesh views and a granularity request go to the visual planner.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Coarse, medium and fine partitions come from the same segmentation model.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Segment the two swords and the hands.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The requested parts receive distinct labels; the rest becomes background.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Only the text changes: the requested part list determines the output granularity.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:19.000
One FlexPart model. Different text prompts. The partition you ask for.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Generalization to AIGC assets: four generated assets, three levels of detail.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Tracked machine: prompt-controlled granularity on AI-generated geometry.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Sci-fi blaster: coarse, medium and fine partitions.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Armored character: coarse, medium and fine partitions.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Winged robot: coarse, medium and fine partitions.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:10.000
The input text determines both the granularity and the parts to extract.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.000
what you ask for is what you get

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:22.000
FlexPart: Text-Controlled Semantics-Aware 3D Part Segmentation at Flexible Granularity
